00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:50.220
Imagine if Monogatari and Yuri on Ice

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.220
Imagine if Monogatari and Yuri on Ice had a Persona-flavored

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.280
