00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.060
Imagine if Monogatari and Yuri on Ice had a Persona-flavored frog baby that was anally conceived in Bollywood.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.860
You're watching three boys get transformed into frogs or kappas

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:59.120
when they get eaten butt-first by another kappa

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:02.420
as they enter people's anuses in order to consume their desire.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:05.780
