00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:07.300
they just eat ass,

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.500
it's about eating ass,

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.320
yes, someone FINALLY MADE AN ANIME about

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.080
yes, someone FINALLY MADE AN ANIME about ＥＡＴＩＮＧ ＡＳ－

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:15.280
Inuhara's work is famous for being very out there on the surface level

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.320
requiring you to dig through its many layers to come to your own conclusion,

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.140
which is this definitely is, but that's currently the appeal of it.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.760
I mean, you look at something like this, and

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.120
m a y b e you see a message about hidden desires

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.280
explored through the lens of traditional Japanese folklore

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:28.620
